<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-REPSHE SAYS WILL STAND AGAIN AS C.BANK CHIEF.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-REPSHE SAYS WILL STAND AGAIN AS C.BANK CHIEF.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Central bank chief Einar Repshe on Wednesday said that he will stand again as head of the Bank of Latvia when parliament in September chooses the leader of the institution for the next six years.</p>
<p>&quot;I will not withdraw my candidacy...I will be available,&quot; Repshe told Reuters in an interview.</p>
<p>He said that the prime minister would nominate the head of the central bank and believed that he some supporters in parliament and some who were against him.</p>
<p>-- Patrick Lannin, Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
